"""Region / country pools: names, cities, phone formats, universities, employers.

All organisations are real. All people are fictional combinations of common
first and last names for that region.

Phone spec: (country_code, mobile_prefixes, national_digits, display_patterns)
  - every '#' in a display pattern consumes one digit of the national number,
    so all patterns for a country render the same underlying number.
  - E.164 form is always "+" + country_code + national digits.

University tuple: (name, city, types) where types is a set drawn from
  eng, sci, biz, arts, law, med, nurse, pharm, design, hotel, edu, all
"""

